Error [E0204]: `solver` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> builtin_mut_receiver_uses_two_phase_reservation_5.jet:5:27
    |
  5 |     solver.require(solver.failure_count() == 0)
    |                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&solver`) only once, or copy first with `~solver`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204

